cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the associated manuscript."
title: "GPCR SelectivityMap"
abstract: >-
  An open, auditable toolkit for static receptor profiling and phylogeny-aware
  benchmarking of class A G protein-coupled receptors. It separates bound-class
  association, family-constrained signal, and transferable evidence before
  biological interpretation, and does not report calibrated functional G protein
  coupling probabilities.
